          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi fulla waan Mana Waaqati baasani iti olkayani qooda Waaqa baasani taanaani, mid'aani oobrutifi mid'aani mukha ka qara bilchaata ka ganna ch'ufa Waaqaa baasani taanaani, nama eegu ka mataa iti tolchani. Worri suni qooda mid'aani, ka Seera, gula qaaloleefi worra Lawiti baasani, oobru d'aatu diraa jirtu keesaa guure olkayuu male. Worri Yuda ch'ufti waan qaaloleefi worri Lawi tahe ch'ufa iraa gammade, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
